  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734038",
      "title": "Submitting Data Programmatically",
      "sourceHash": "260a0c022452c3d0aae04f0b5737019f0db54aadc5ff3c0cfeddeab5a3e874d1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "So we learned how we can use actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 8.13,
          "en": "to submit data or React to the submission of forms,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.13,
          "end": 10.53,
          "en": "and leverage this React Router feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.53,
          "end": 13.02,
          "en": "to outsource that code that should run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.02,
          "end": 16.14,
          "en": "upon a form submission from our components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.14,
          "end": 18.633,
          "en": "into these separate action functions here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.92,
          "end": 22.74,
          "en": "Now before we take a closer look at what we can do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.74,
          "end": 26.4,
          "en": "with such action functions, I wanna show you a different way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.4,
          "end": 29.79,
          "en": "of triggering such a action function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.79,
          "end": 33,
          "en": "The typical and default way is to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33,
          "end": 36.96,
          "en": "use this special form component offered by React Router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.96,
          "end": 39.36,
          "en": "that's the standard way you should use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.36,
          "end": 43.07,
          "en": "This form will automatically trigger the action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.07,
          "end": 45.24,
          "en": "of the currently active route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.24,
          "end": 48.63,
          "en": "so the route for which this form was loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.63,
          "end": 51.81,
          "en": "Now you could send the request to a different route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.81,
          "end": 56.81,
          "en": "by adding the action prop here to this form component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.88,
          "end": 60.27,
          "en": "and setting this to any other path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.27,
          "end": 64.23,
          "en": "Then in that case, the action of another path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.23,
          "end": 68.16,
          "en": "of another route definition object, would be triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.16,
          "end": 71.07,
          "en": "So if you had an action on some other route here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 73.41,
          "en": "you could point at that action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.41,
          "end": 78.22200000000001,
          "en": "by simply setting the form's action prop value to the path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.22200000000001,
          "end": 82.65,
          "en": "of the route for which you wanna trigger the action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.65,
          "end": 84.33,
          "en": "but if you wanna trigger the action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.33,
          "end": 85.95,
          "en": "of the currently active route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.95,
          "end": 88.86,
          "en": "you don't need the action prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.86,
          "end": 91.23,
          "en": "But that's just one of the things I wanna show you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.23,
          "end": 93.87,
          "en": "I also wanna show you a totally different way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.87,
          "end": 96.3,
          "en": "of triggering an action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.3,
          "end": 97.92,
          "en": "And for that, let's take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.92,
          "end": 102.9,
          "en": "at the event detail component here, this event detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.9,
          "end": 105.96000000000001,
          "en": "There we display the event item component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.96000000000001,
          "end": 108.99000000000001,
          "en": "and this event item component actually has a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.99000000000001,
          "end": 111.18,
          "en": "that allows us to delete events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.18,
          "end": 112.68,
          "en": "but currently it's not working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.68,
          "end": 114.33,
          "en": "because the function which we trigger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.33,
          "end": 116.943,
          "en": "upon a click on the button doesn't do anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.793,
          "end": 121.59,
          "en": "Now, it would be reasonable that here in this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.59,
          "end": 124.98,
          "en": "we maybe first of all wanna prompt the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.98,
          "end": 129.36,
          "en": "whether he or she really wants to delete this event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.36,
          "end": 132.42,
          "en": "For this, we could use the built in confirm function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.42,
          "end": 136.32,
          "en": "that's built into the browser, and ask are you sure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.32,
          "end": 141.24,
          "en": "and this will return a Boolean, so true or false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.24,
          "end": 144.96,
          "en": "and if it's true, so if we're in this if block,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.96,
          "end": 147.87,
          "en": "then we might wanna trigger an action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.87,
          "end": 151.44,
          "en": "that goes ahead and deletes this event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.44,
          "end": 154.62,
          "en": "Now, for that as a first step, we must add an action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.62,
          "end": 156.15,
          "en": "that should be triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.15,
          "end": 158.73,
          "en": "And since event item will be rendered as part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 158.73,
          "end": 161.7,
          "en": "of the event detail page component, which is loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.7,
          "end": 164.82,
          "en": "for this event detail route here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.82,
          "end": 168.75,
          "en": "we should add the action to this event detail route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 171.3,
          "en": "Alternatively, we add the action somewhere else,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.3,
          "end": 174.18,
          "en": "and we make sure that we send the request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.18,
          "end": 175.29,
          "en": "to a different path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.29,
          "end": 177.9,
          "en": "but I'll get back to this in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.9,
          "end": 179.97,
          "en": "For the moment, I want to the action here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.97,
          "end": 182.25,
          "en": "to this event detail page route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.25,
          "end": 185.28,
          "en": "and therefore here, in EventDetail.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.28,
          "end": 187.59,
          "en": "I will add this action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.59,
          "end": 190.47,
          "en": "just as I added the loader function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.47,
          "end": 194.43,
          "en": "So here I add the action function, can be a async function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.43,
          "end": 197.1,
          "en": "so that we can use async await.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.1,
          "end": 201.36,
          "en": "And here we then want to add the code for deleting an event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.36,
          "end": 204.32999999999998,
          "en": "For that, we wanna use the good old fetch function again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.32999999999998,
          "end": 206.79,
          "en": "to send a request to the backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.79,
          "end": 210.27,
          "en": "and here the URL and the path to which we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 210.27,
          "end": 213.54,
          "en": "to send the request is slash events slash,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.54,
          "end": 216.663,
          "en": "and then the ID of the event that should be deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.62,
          "end": 220.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now, we can get that ID with help of the parents object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.92000000000002,
          "end": 224.313,
          "en": "which we get for actions just as we do for loaders.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 225.15,
          "end": 228.9,
          "en": "So here we got the event ID by accessing params.eventId,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 228.9,
          "end": 231.03,
          "en": "which is exactly the same approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.03,
          "end": 232.653,
          "en": "we take in our loader here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 234,
          "end": 236.883,
          "en": "Now we can add that here in this URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.32,
          "end": 241.8,
          "en": "We can then await this, and we get our response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 241.8,
          "end": 246.51,
          "en": "And just as before, we can check if our response is okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 246.51,
          "end": 249.51,
          "en": "and for that I'll just copy the code from the loader",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 249.51,
          "end": 253.86,
          "en": "and just alter the error message, if we have an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 253.86,
          "end": 257.37,
          "en": "where I say could not delete event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 257.37,
          "end": 259.57,
          "en": "because that's what we're trying to do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 261,
          "end": 264.36,
          "en": "And else if we are successful, we know that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 264.36,
          "end": 268.05,
          "en": "well, we're done, and we want to probably redirect the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 268.05,
          "end": 270.51,
          "en": "so here in that case, if we make it past this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 270.51,
          "end": 273.42,
          "en": "if check where we check if the response is okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 273.42,
          "end": 277.40999999999997,
          "en": "I will return redirect to redirect the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 277.40999999999997,
          "end": 279.72,
          "en": "and load a different route with help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 279.72,
          "end": 282.69,
          "en": "of the built-in redirect function, which is imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 282.69,
          "end": 286.38,
          "en": "from React Router and redirect the user to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 286.38,
          "end": 291,
          "en": "let's say events, so to a list of all events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 291,
          "end": 292.35,
          "en": "that's what we can do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.43,
          "end": 297.27,
          "en": "And now since we're exporting this action here in App.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.27,
          "end": 302.27,
          "en": "we can import it as delete event action, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.35,
          "end": 312.303,
          "en": "and then assign this to the action property of this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 313.56,
          "end": 315.36,
          "en": "But how do we now trigger this action?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 315.36,
          "end": 317.373,
          "en": "That was the part I wanted to show you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 318.3,
          "end": 321.57,
          "en": "We could theoretically go to event item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 321.57,
          "end": 323.58,
          "en": "and wrap this button with a form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 323.58,
          "end": 326.64,
          "en": "We could add this form component here, but in that case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 326.64,
          "end": 330.21,
          "en": "we would not be prompted whether we want to proceed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 330.21,
          "end": 332.58,
          "en": "We wouldn't see this confirmation prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 332.58,
          "end": 334.86,
          "en": "and I wanna see that to give the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 334.86,
          "end": 337.593,
          "en": "a chance of canceling the deletion process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 338.82,
          "end": 341.31,
          "en": "So we need to trigger that action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 341.31,
          "end": 346.11,
          "en": "and submit some data, so to say, programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 346.11,
          "end": 348.93,
          "en": "And just as we can navigate programmatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 348.93,
          "end": 350.49,
          "en": "we can also submit data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 350.49,
          "end": 352.96,
          "en": "and trigger an action programmatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 354,
          "end": 357.42,
          "en": "with the special use submit hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 357.42,
          "end": 361.62,
          "en": "This hook is imported from react-router-dom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 361.62,
          "end": 365.31,
          "en": "and it gives you a submit function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 365.31,
          "end": 367.173,
          "en": "which I'm storing in a constant here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 368.549,
          "end": 371.16,
          "en": "And we can call this submit function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 371.16,
          "end": 374.55,
          "en": "if we wanna proceed, and to this submit function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 374.55,
          "end": 376.743,
          "en": "we can pass two arguments.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 377.64,
          "end": 380.613,
          "en": "The first argument is the data that we wanna submit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 381.48,
          "end": 384.24,
          "en": "and that data will automatically be wrapped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 384.24,
          "end": 387.54,
          "en": "in a form data object, which we then could extract",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 387.54,
          "end": 390.72,
          "en": "with this special form data method we saw",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 390.72,
          "end": 392.22,
          "en": "when creating a new event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 392.22,
          "end": 394.71,
          "en": "so this method, the data we passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 394.71,
          "end": 398.55,
          "en": "to the submit function would automatically be wrapped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 398.55,
          "end": 400.593,
          "en": "with such a form data object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 401.58,
          "end": 403.56,
          "en": "but here I actually need no data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 403.56,
          "end": 404.973,
          "en": "so we can set this to null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 406.2,
          "end": 409.47,
          "en": "The second argument then allows us to basically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 409.47,
          "end": 413.49,
          "en": "set the same values we could set on a form, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 413.49,
          "end": 416.22,
          "en": "the method which we can set to delete in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 416.22,
          "end": 418.14,
          "en": "which would be an appropriate method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 418.14,
          "end": 420.42,
          "en": "for this client side request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 420.42,
          "end": 422.49,
          "en": "which is handled on the client side,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 422.49,
          "end": 425.463,
          "en": "and which triggers this action function as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 426.63,
